<title>UK: SNCF sets $250 million Eurobond due Aug 2002.</title>
<headline>SNCF sets $250 million Eurobond due Aug 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE NATIONALE DES CHEMINS DE FER</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    19.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.455   PAY DATE   S19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.83     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND US 5-YEAR W/I</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
